# This file used to hold the full project AI rules (~190 lines).
# That content was migrated into `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` and `AGENTS.md`
# so Cursor can load scoped rules instead of one always-on blob
# (`.cursorrules` is legacy; the modern layout is preferred).
# What remains here is a pointer for older tooling that still reads this file.

# Legacy `.cursorrules` (compatibility shim)

Project rules have moved to the modern Cursor layout:

| Resource | Path |
|----------|------|
| Always / scoped rules | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` |
| Cross-agent brief | `AGENTS.md` |
| Cursor MCP | `.cursor/mcp.json` |
| Project skills | `.cursor/skills/` |
| Slash commands | `.cursor/commands/` |
| Deep project docs | `.ai-context/` |

Do not duplicate long guidance here. Agents should follow `.cursor/rules/` and `AGENTS.md`.
